    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d161">

                <pb facs="0168" n="118" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav03/pg118"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/1599</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Francis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-04-16T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 16, 1918,
                                6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>71. Your 87, April 10, 10 p.m., somewhat garbled, but statement wholly
                    unauthorized by this Government, Thompson does not speak for this Government or
                    represent it in any way whatsoever. Department has no knowledge whatever of this
                    matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
